ss=\"cert-card-top\">\n<div class=\"cert-badge-icon\" style=\"background:linear-gradient(135deg,#1e3a5f,#3b82f6)\">CAAD</div>\n<div><div class=\"cert-card-name\">Certified Avionics Software Developer</div><div class=\"cert-card-abbr\">CAAD</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"cert-card-desc\">DO-178C/DO-330 compliance, ARINC 653, FACE architecture, avionics data buses (ARINC 429, MIL-STD-1553), and DAL A/B software development.</div>\n<div class=\"cert-card-meta\">\n<span class=\"cert-meta-tag level-expert\">Expert</span>\n<span class=\"cert-meta-tag duration\">⏱ 9 months</span>\n<span class=\"cert-meta-tag free\">Free Exam</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"cert-card\" data-track=\"aerospace\">\n<div class=\"cert-card-top\">\n<div class=\"cert-badge-icon\" style=\"background:linear-gradient(135deg,#1e3a5f,#3b82f6)\">CSSE</div>\n<div><div class=\"cert-card-name\">Certified Space Systems Embedded Engineer</div><div class=\"cert-card-abbr\">CSSE</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"cert-card-desc\">Radiation-hardened electronics, fault-tolerant design, ECSS standards, CubeSat/SmallSat embedded systems, and space-grade software development.</div>\n<div class=\"cert-card-meta\">\n<span class=\"cert-meta-tag level-expert\">Expert</span>\n<span class=\"cert-meta-tag duration\">⏱ 9 months</span>\n<span class=\"cert-meta-tag free\">Free Exam</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"cert-card\" data-track=\"aerospace\">\n<div class=\"cert-card-top\">\n<div class=\"cert-badge-icon\" style=\"background:linear-gradient(135deg,#1e3a5f,#3b82f6)\">CUAV</div>\n<div><div class=\"cert-card-name\">Certified UAV/Drone Systems Engineer</div><div class=\"cert-card-abbr\">CUAV</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"cert-card-desc\">Flight controller firmware, PX4/ArduPilot architecture, sensor fusion (IMU/GPS/barometer), MAVLink protocol, and FAA Part 107 compliance.</div>\n<div class=\"cert-card-meta\">\n<span class=\"cert-meta-tag level-professional\">Professional</span>\n<span class=\"cert-meta-tag duration\">⏱ 6 months</span>\n<span class=\"cert-meta-tag free\">Free Exam</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"cert-card\" data-track=\"aerospace\">\n<div class=\"cert-card-top\">\n<div class=\"cert-badge-icon\" style=\"background:linear-gradient(135deg,#1e3a5f,#3b82f6)\">CDSE</div>\n<div><div class=\"cert-card-name\">Certified Defense Systems Embedded Engineer</div><div class=\"cert-card-abbr\">CDSE</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"cert-card-desc\">MIL-STD-810/461/498, TEMPEST requirements, secure communications (HAIPE/Type 1), ruggedized embedded design, and defense acquisition lifecycle.</div>\n<div class=\"cert-card-meta\">\n<span class=\"cert-meta-tag level-expert\">Expert</span>\n<span class=\"cert-meta-tag duration\">⏱ 8 months</span>\n<span class=\"cert-meta-tag free\">Free Exam</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"cert-card\" data-track=\"aerospace\">\n<div class=\"cert-card-top\">\n<div class=\"cert-badge-icon\" style=\"background:linear-gradient(135deg,#1e3a5f,#3b82f6)\">CRSE</div>\n<div><div class=\"cert-card-name\">Certified Robotics Systems Engineer</div><div class=\"cert-card-abbr\">CRSE</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"cert-card-desc\">ROS2 embedded, real-time motion control, kinematics/dynamics, embedded vision, and safety-certified robotics for industrial and defense applications.</div>\n<div class=\"cert-card-meta\">\n<span class=\"cert-meta-tag level-professional\">Professional</span>\n<span class=\"cert-meta-tag duration\">⏱ 6 months</span>\n<span class=\"cert-meta-tag free\">Free Exam</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- Track 12: Foundation -->\n<div class=\"cert-track\" data-track-id=\"foundation\">\n<div class=\"cert-track-header\">\n<div class=\"cert-track-icon\" style=\"background:linear-gradient(135deg,#374151,#9ca3af)\">🎓</div>\n<div>\n<div class=\"cert-track-title\">Foundation &amp; Entry-Level Certifications</div>\n<div class=\"cert-track-desc\">Starting points for students, career changers, and embedded systems newcomers</div>\n</div>\n<span class=\"cert-track-count\">7 certs</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"cert-cards\">\n<div class=\"cert-card\" data-track=\"foundation\">\n<div class=\"cert-card-top\">\n<div class=\"cert-badge-icon\" style=\"background:linear-gradient(135deg,#374151,#9ca3af)\">CEFE</div>\n<div><div class=\"cert-card-name\">Certified Embedded Fundamentals Engineer</div><div class=\"cert-card-abbr\">CEFE</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"cert-card-desc\">Introduction to embedded systems: C programming, microcontroller basics, GPIO/ADC/PWM, simple RTOS concepts, and first embedded project development.</div>\n<div class=\"cert-card-meta\">\n<span class=\"cert-meta-tag level-foundation\">Foundation</span>\n<span class=\"cert-meta-tag duration\">⏱ 2 months</span>\n<span class=\"cert-meta-tag free\">Free Exam</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"cert-card\" data-track=\"foundation\">\n<div class=\"cert-card-top\">\n<div class=\"cert-badge-icon\" style=\"background:linear-gradient(135deg,#374151,#9ca3af)\">CEAI-F</div>\n<div><div class=\"cert-card-name\">Embedded AI Foundations</div><div class=\"cert-card-abbr\">EAI-F</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"cert-card-desc\">Introduction to AI/ML concepts for embedded engineers: neural networks, model training basics, TensorFlow Lite Micro, and first edge AI deployment.</div>\n<div class=\"cert-card-meta\">\n<span class=\"cert-meta-tag level-foundation\">Foundation</span>\n<span class=\"cert-meta-tag duration\">⏱ 2 months</span>\n<span class=\"cert-meta-tag free\">Free Exam</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"cert-card\" data-track=\"foundation\">\n<div class=\"cert-card-top\">\n<div class=\"cert-badge-icon\" style=\"background:linear-gradient(135deg,#374151,#9ca3af)\">CIOT-F</div>\n<div><div class=\"cert-card-name\">IoT Foundations Certificate</div><div class=\"cert-card-abbr\">IoT-F</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"cert-card-desc\">IoT ecosystem overview, basic wireless protocols, cloud connectivity, sensor interfacing, and building your first connected embedded device.</div>\n<div class=\"cert-card-meta\">\n<span class=\"cert-meta-tag level-foundation\">Foundation</span>\n<span class=\"cert-meta-tag duration\">⏱ 2 months</span>\n<span class=\"cert-meta-tag free\">Free Exam</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"cert-card\" data-track=\"foundation\">\n<div class=\"cert-card-top\">\n<div class=\"cert-badge-icon\" style=\"background:linear-gradient(135deg,#374151,#9ca3af)\">CSEC-F</div>\n<div><div class=\"cert-card-name\">Embedded Security Foundations</div><div class=\"cert-card-abbr\">SEC-F</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"cert-card-desc\">Security fundamentals for embedded engineers: common vulnerabilities, basic cryptography, secure coding practices, and introduction to threat modeling.</div>\n<div class=\"cert-card-meta\">\n<span class=\"cert-meta-tag level-foundation\">Foundation</span>\n<span class=\"cert-meta-tag duration\">⏱ 2 months</span>\n<span class=\"cert-meta-tag free\">Free Exam</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"cert-card\" data-track=\"foundation\">\n<div class=\"cert-card-top\">\n<div class=\"cert-badge-icon\" style=\"background:linear-gradient(135deg,#374151,#9ca3af)\">CBCI-F</div>\n<div><div class=\"cert-card-name\">Neural Interface Foundations</div><div class=\"cert-card-abbr\">NI-F</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"cert-card-desc\">Introduction to brain-computer interfaces, neuroscience basics for engineers, EEG signal fundamentals, and the BCI technology landscape.</div>\n<div class=\"cert-card-meta\">\n<span class=\"cert-meta-tag level-foundation\">Foundation</span>\n<span class=\"cert-meta-tag duration\">⏱ 2 months</span>\n<span class=\"cert-meta-tag free\">Free Exam</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"cert-card\" data-track=\"foundation\">\n<div class=\"cert-card-top\">\n<div class=\"cert-badge-icon\" style=\"background:linear-gradient(135deg,#374151,#9ca3af)\">CRTOS-F</div>\n<div><div class=\"cert-card-name\">RTOS Foundations Certificate</div><div class=\"cert-card-abbr\">RTOS-F</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"cert-card-desc\">Real-time concepts, task scheduling basics, FreeRTOS introduction, semaphores and queues, and building your first multitasking embedded application.</div>\n<div class=\"cert-card-meta\">\n<span class=\"cert-meta-tag level-foundation\">Foundation</span>\n<span class=\"cert-meta-tag duration\">⏱ 2 months</span>\n<span class=\"cert-meta-tag free\">Free Exam</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"cert-card\" data-track=\"foundation\">\n<div class=\"cert-card-top\">\n<div class=\"cert-badge-icon\" style=\"background:linear-gradient(135deg,#374151,#9ca3af)\">CHWD-F</div>\n<div><div class=\"cert-card-name\">Hardware Design Foundations</div><div class=\"cert-card-abbr\">HWD-F</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"cert-card-desc\">Electronics fundamentals, basic schematic reading, breadboard prototyping, introduction to PCB design tools, and first hardware project build.</div>\n<div class=\"cert-card-meta\">\n<span class=\"cert-meta-tag level-foundation\">Foundation</span>\n<span class=\"cert-meta-tag duration\">⏱ 2 months</span>\n<span class=\"cert-meta-tag free\">Free Exam</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- HOW TO APPLY -->\n<div class=\"apply-section\">\n<h2 style=\"font-size:1.5rem;font-weight:800;margin-bottom:.5rem\">How to Earn Your Certification</h2>\n<p style=\"color:rgba(255,255,255,.6);font-size:.9rem\">All certifications are free to attempt. As a 501(c)(3) non-profit, we reinvest all program fees into open-source research and community education.</p>\n<div class=\"apply-steps\">\n<div class=\"apply-step\">\n<div class=\"apply-step-num\">1</div>\n<div class=\"apply-step-title\">Choose Your Track</div>\n<div class=\"apply-step-desc\">Select the certification that matches your career goals and current experience level.</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"apply-step\">\n<div class=\"apply-step-num\">2</div>\n<div class=\"apply-step-title\">Study the Curriculum</div>\n<div class=\"apply-step-desc\">Access free study materials, open-source projects, and community resources on our GitHub.</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"apply-step\">\n<div class=\"apply-step-num\">3</div>\n<div class=\"apply-step-title\">Apply Online</div>\n<div class=\"apply-step-desc\">Submit your application via email. No upfront fees — we believe in accessible education.</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"apply-step\">\n<div class=\"apply-step-num\">4</div>\n<div class=\"apply-step-title\">Complete Assessment</div>\n<div class=\"apply-step-desc\">Take the online exam and/or submit a practical project demonstrating your skills.</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"apply-step\">\n<div class=\"apply-step-num\">5</div>\n<div class=\"apply-step-title\">Earn Your Badge</div>\n<div class=\"apply-step-desc\">Receive your digital credential and printable certificate. Share on LinkedIn and GitHub.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- CTA -->\n<div class=\"cert-cta\">\n<h2>Ready to Get Certified?</h2>\n<p>Join thousands of embedded engineers who have advanced their careers with EmbeddedOS Foundation certifications. All programs are free as part of our non-profit mission.</p>\n<div class=\"cert-cta-btns\">\n<a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"mailto:certification@embeddedos.org?subject=Certification Application\">Apply for Certification</a>\n<a class=\"btn btn-outline\" href=\"membership.html\">Become a Member First</a>\n<a class=\"btn btn-outline\" href=\"donate.html\">Support Our Mission</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><!-- /container -->\n</main>\n<!-- FOOTER -->\n<footer>\n<div class=\"footer-grid\">\n<div class=\"footer-column footer-brand-col\">\n<a aria-label=\"EmbeddedOS Home\" class=\"logo footer-logo\" href=\"/\">\n<div class=\"logo-icon\">EoS</div>\n<span class=\"logo-text\">Embedded<span>OS</span></span>\n</a>\n<p class=\"footer-tagline\">Open-source embedded OS, neural interfaces, and AI-powered edge computing — built by the community, for the community.</p>\n<p style=\"font-size:.78rem;color:rgba(255,255,255,.35);margin-top:.5rem\">501(c)(3) Non-Profit · EIN: Available on request</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"footer-column\">\n<h4>Research</h4>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"research.html\">Neural Link Architecture</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"ai-os.html\">AI Operating Systems</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"building-os.html\">Building OS</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"future-research.html\">Future Research</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"roadmap.html\">Roadmap</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"changelog.html\">Changelog</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"footer-column\">\n<h4>Programs</h4>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"membership.html\">Membership</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"certification.html\">Certification</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"internship.html\">Internships</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"careers.html\">Careers</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"donate.html\">Donate</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"resources.html\">Resources</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"footer-column\">\n<h4>Foundation</h4>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"about.html\">About Us</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"contact.html\">Contact</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"donate.html\">Support Our Mission</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"faq.html\">FAQ</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"privacy.html\">Privacy Policy</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"terms.html\">Terms of Service</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"code-of-conduct.html\">Code of Conduct</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"mailto:help@embeddedos.org\">help@embeddedos.org</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"footer-newsletter\">\n<h4>📬 Stay in the Loop</h4>\n<p>Get research updates, release notes, and community news — no spam, ever.</p>\n<form action=\"#\" class=\"newsletter-form\" id=\"newsletterForm\" method=\"post\">\n<input aria-label=\"Email for newsletter\" placeholder=\"your@email.com\" required=\"\" type=\"email\">\n<button type=\"submit\">Subscribe</button>\n</form>\n<div class=\"newsletter-msg\" id=\"newsletterMsg\">✓ Thanks for subscribing!</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"footer-divider\"></div>\n<div class=\"footer-bottom\">\n<div class=\"footer-brand\">\n<span class=\"logo-text\">Embedded<span>OS</span></span>\n<div class=\"footer-social\">\n<a aria-label=\"EmbeddedOS on GitHub\" href=\"https://github.com/embeddedos-org\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">GitHub</a>\n<a aria-label=\"EmbeddedOS on X\" href=\"https://x.com/EmbeddedOS_ORG\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">X</a>\n<a aria-label=\"EmbeddedOS on LinkedIn\" href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/embedded-operating-systems-research-foundation\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">LinkedIn</a>\n<a aria-label=\"EmbeddedOS on YouTube\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@EmbeddedOS_ORG\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">YouTube</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"footer-copyright\">© 2026 EmbeddedOS (EoS) Research Foundation. A 501(c)(3) nonprofit. All rights reserved.</div>\n<div class=\"footer-legal\">\n<a href=\"privacy.html\">Privacy</a>\n<a href=\"terms.html\">Terms</a>\n<a href=\"privacy.html#cookies\">Cookies</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center;padding:.6rem 0 0;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08);margin-top:.75rem;font-size:.75rem\">Powered by <a href=\"https://www.interserver.net\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"font-weight:600;text-decoration:none\" target=\"_blank\">InterServer</a></div>\n</footer>";
